{"id":"1844f67828428aae","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence.md","title":"一阶公式的绑定结构与α等价","display":"df-formula-alpha-equivalence — 一阶公式的绑定结构与α等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence","aliases":["72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence"],"display":"df-formula-alpha-equivalence — 一阶公式的绑定结构与α等价","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.2, print31–32/PDF43–44; explicit local binding-structure encoding","source_kind":"source-driven-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_23":"统一签名关系分量与单个关系符号的记号"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-alpha-equivalence — 一阶公式的绑定结构与α等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.2, print31–32/PDF43–44; explicit local binding-structure encoding"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-driven-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"统一签名关系分量与单个关系符号的记号"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>、项集和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec b\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec b\\in V^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是由内到外排列的绑定变量栈；允许同名变量重复，最小下标给最近的绑定者。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式各整数首标签只用于本地绑定结构编码，与原语法树构造子分开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf d_t,\\mathsf d_f\">\\(\\mathsf d_t,\\mathsf d_f\\)</span> 按有限项、公式树递归；函数与关系参数表保留次序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X_\\Sigma\">\\(S\\subseteq X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> 取既有五分量签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in R\">\\(\\rho\\in R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\vec t|\">\\(|\\vec t|\\)</span> 分别等于所用符号的已给定元数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(x,\\vec b):=\\{j&lt;|\\vec b|:b_j=x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(x,\\vec b):=\\{j&lt;|\\vec b|:b_j=x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf d_t(x,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\langle0,x\\rangle,&amp;J(x,\\vec b)=\\varnothing,\\\\\\langle1,\\min J(x,\\vec b)\\rangle,&amp;J(x,\\vec b)\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf d_t(c,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle2,c\\rangle\\quad(c\\in C),\\\\\n\\mathsf d_t(f(\\vec t),\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle3,\\langle f,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t_i,\\vec b)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\rho(\\vec t),\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle4,\\langle\\rho,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t_i,\\vec b)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(t\\doteq u,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle5,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_t(u,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\top,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle6,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf d_f(\\bot,\\vec b):=\\langle7,0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\neg A,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle8,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\land B,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle9,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\lor B,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle10,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\to B,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle11,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\forall xA,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle12,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\exists xA,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle13,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle\\rangle)=\\mathsf d_f(B,\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma(S)&amp;:=\\{B\\in X_\\Sigma:\\exists A\\in S\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf d_t(x,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\langle0,x\\rangle,&amp;J(x,\\vec b)=\\varnothing,\\\\\\langle1,\\min J(x,\\vec b)\\rangle,&amp;J(x,\\vec b)\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf d_t(c,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle2,c\\rangle\\quad(c\\in C),\\\\\n\\mathsf d_t(f(\\vec t),\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle3,\\langle f,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t_i,\\vec b)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\rho(\\vec t),\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle4,\\langle\\rho,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t_i,\\vec b)\\rangle_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(t\\doteq u,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle5,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_t(u,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\top,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle6,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf d_f(\\bot,\\vec b):=\\langle7,0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\neg A,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle8,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\land B,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle9,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\lor B,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle10,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\to B,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle11,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\forall xA,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle12,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\exists xA,\\vec b)&amp;:=\\langle13,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle\\rangle)=\\mathsf d_f(B,\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma(S)&amp;:=\\{B\\in X_\\Sigma:\\exists A\\in S\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 I§2.3.1–2.3.2（印刷31–32/PDF43–44）以两类变量避免捕获，并明确指出若不采用该约定必须调整消切陈述。本册原接口使用同一变量集，故需要实际的约束变量改名关系，不能只在 Remark 宣称已经取 α 商。</p>\n<p>绑定结构编码保留自由变量的原名、函数和关系符号及每个最近绑定者的位置，忘掉的只有量词变量名。有限树递归及有限非空集合上的最小值使所有分支唯一。它能区分捕获：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xP(x,y)\">\\(\\forall xP(x,y)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall yP(y,y)\">\\(\\forall yP(y,y)\\)</span> 的第二个参数分别是自由变量和绑定位置，因此不等价。此编码是配套实现，不声称原书使用 de Bruijn 编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec b\\in V^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf d_t,\\mathsf d_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"|\\vec t|","display":false},{"tex":"J(x,\\vec b):=\\{j<|\\vec b|:b_j=x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf d_t(x,\\vec b)&:=\\begin{cases}\\langle0,x\\rangle,&J(x,\\vec b)=\\varnothing,\\\\\\langle1,\\min J(x,\\vec b)\\rangle,&J(x,\\vec b)\\ne\\varnothing,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathsf d_t(c,\\vec b)&:=\\langle2,c\\rangle\\quad(c\\in C),\\\\\n\\mathsf d_t(f(\\vec t),\\vec b)&:=\\langle3,\\langle f,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t_i,\\vec b)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec t|}\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\rho(\\vec t),\\vec b)&:=\\langle4,\\langle\\rho,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t_i,\\vec b)\\rangle_{i<|\\vec t|}\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(t\\doteq u,\\vec b)&:=\\langle5,\\langle\\mathsf d_t(t,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_t(u,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\top,\\vec b)&:=\\langle6,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf d_f(\\bot,\\vec b):=\\langle7,0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\neg A,\\vec b)&:=\\langle8,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\land B,\\vec b)&:=\\langle9,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\lor B,\\vec b)&:=\\langle10,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(A\\to B,\\vec b)&:=\\langle11,\\langle\\mathsf d_f(A,\\vec b),\\mathsf d_f(B,\\vec b)\\rangle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\forall xA,\\vec b)&:=\\langle12,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf d_f(\\exists xA,\\vec b)&:=\\langle13,\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\vec b)\\rangle,\\\\\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf d_f(A,\\langle\\rangle)=\\mathsf d_f(B,\\langle\\rangle),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma(S)&:=\\{B\\in X_\\Sigma:\\exists A\\in S\\ (A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall xP(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall yP(y,y)","display":false}],"bytes":3822,"backlinks":[{"id":"64d508412cdc602b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]，按绑定结构相等定义；它不包括一般语义等价公式。"},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"62a32ca4e63fca90","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\Sigma}B$ 取 [[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]。在 $\\mathsf{Rules}_{P,r}$ 中增设同一有限公式集合内的一个成员改名；该规则不引入 identity 或 Cut。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"855e440d9df6186d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d48429d76b7862cc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"b2d9e5da3806795d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3c073b947b255638"]}